# Theia
gen-webpack*.js
gen-esbuild*.mjs
.theia/
# Generated by `theia build`, and its content depends on the build mode:
# frontend-generator emits `import(` for development and `require(` for
# production, so a tracked copy flips back and forth. `pnpm clean` deletes it,
# CI regenerates it, and electron-builder reads it off disk like lib/.
src-gen/

